  "description": "A fully managed 2D drawing library with no native dependencies of any kind - everything renders in pure managed code. Provides the same drawing, painting, and highlighting API as CodeBrix.Imaging.Drawing, plus SVG rendering, working directly on in-memory pixel data. Use this instead of CodeBrix.Imaging.Drawing when you can't or don't want to bring in SkiaSharp or any other native graphics library. Never reference both packages in the same project - they define the same types under the same namespace and will conflict.",
